From f5711c5a8a43d9a97374e65efa321a01600e52c1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rust-mos-sync <rust-mos-sync@localhost>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 17:31:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rust_target: use underscores in target_vendor of hyphenated
 MOS platforms

cfg(target_vendor = "nes_nrom") rather than "nes-nrom"; the target names
and SDK linker names keep their hyphens.
---
